urface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","book_id":"b-shiji-007","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:p027","text":"項王之救彭城，追漢王至滎陽，田橫亦得收齊，立田榮子廣為齊王。漢王之敗彭城，諸侯皆復與楚而背漢。漢軍滎陽，築甬道屬之河，以取敖倉粟。漢之三年，項王數侵奪漢甬道，漢王食乏，恐，請和，割滎陽以西為漢。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"田橫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000712","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"田榮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0025","start":25,"end":26,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000721","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、群體、動物或未定指代保留待核；不補姓名、闕代或個別成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu:m027-0079","start":79,"end":81,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","book_id":"b-shiji-007","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p034","text":"是時項王北擊齊，田榮與戰城陽。田榮敗，走平原，平原民殺之。齊皆降楚。楚因焚燒其城郭，系虜其子女。齊人叛之。田榮弟橫立榮子廣為齊王，齊王反楚城陽。項羽雖聞漢東，既已連齊兵，欲遂破之而擊漢。漢王以故得劫五諸侯兵，遂入彭城。項羽聞之，乃引兵去齊，從魯出胡陵，至蕭，與漢大戰彭城靈壁東睢水上，大破漢軍，多殺士卒，睢水為之不流。乃取漢王父母妻子於沛，置之軍中以為質。當是時，諸侯見楚彊漢敗，還皆去漢復為楚。塞王欣亡入楚。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"田榮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"田榮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"田榮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"橫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000712","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"榮","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"廣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000721","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"齊王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、假稱或同名指代待覆核；不據字串補姓名或實際爵位。"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"齊王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"官稱、匿名者、假稱或同名指代待覆核；不據字串補姓名或實際爵位。"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0109","start":109,"end":111,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0161","start":161,"end":163,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m034-0198","start":198,"end":201,"surface":"塞王欣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000606","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","book_id":"b-shiji-008","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p050","text":"當此時，彭越將兵居梁地，往來苦楚兵，絕其糧食。田橫往從之。項羽數擊彭越等，齊王信又進擊楚。項羽恐，乃與漢王約，中分天下，割鴻溝而西者為漢，鴻溝而東者為楚。項王歸漢王父母妻子，軍中皆呼萬歲，乃歸而別去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m050-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"彭越","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000707","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m050-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"田橫","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000712","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m050-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m050-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"彭越","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000707","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m050-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"齊王信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000724","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m050-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"項羽","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m050-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m050-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000610","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m050-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","book_id":"b-shiji-008","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-007-xiangyu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-007","source_id":"s-shiji-007-xiangyu","source":{"title":"史記／卷007","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷007","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷007&oldid=5978360","revision_id":5978360,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"本篇傳世正文45個p區塊，自「項籍者」至太史公論贊；不含導覽標題、跨站連結與另署【索隱述贊】的後出注家文字。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"核讀p與dd原有次序；本篇dd僅為正文前跨站導覽，正文45區塊均為p。排除sup註號，保留行內校勘符號待核。","note":"固定版本正文HTML與所讀頁面重讀一致；未核紙本或影像。"}}},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-008","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu","source":{"title":"史記／卷008","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷008","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷008&oldid=2440965","revision_id":2440965,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"本篇傳世正文91個p區塊，自「高祖，沛豐邑中陽里人」至太史公論贊；不含導覽標題、跨站連結及另署【索隱述贊】的後出文字。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{"馕":"饢"},"editorial_readings":[],"extraction_note":"正文91段均為p；前置兩個dd為跨站導覽，不收錄。排除sup註號，保留原有行內校勘符號。","note":"第48、57段馕僅作明示簡繁轉換為饢，詞義與疑讀待核，不逕改為餉或饟。數位轉錄尚未核紙本或影像。"}}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":true}}
